    "property_title": "Duplex Home at Montierra Subdivision",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Looking for a duplex home that’s ready to move in? A place that’s complete, comfortable, and located in a prime area? This might be the one.\r\n\r\nLocation: Uptown Cagayan de Oro\r\nAn area known for peace, safety, and a cool breeze.\r\n\r\nNearby establishments:\r\n• Top schools: Rosevale, Abbas Orchard, Corpus Christi, Xavier School\r\n• Gaisano Uptown for quick errands\r\n• Pueblo Golf Estates\r\n• Banks, restaurants, cafes, and the diversion road for easy access\r\n\r\nHome Details:\r\n• 3 bedrooms plus 1 extra room\r\n• 2 bathrooms\r\n• 2 kitchens\r\n• Along main road (12 ft wide)\r\n• Parasat internet cable ready\r\n\r\nAppliances and Furniture Included:\r\n• 55” Sony TV\r\n• Samsung double-door inverter refrigerator\r\n• Washing machine\r\n• Double burner stove\r\n• Mahogany dining table\r\n• VIP sofa, Magkono wood center table, Magkono chairs\r\n• Sound system with videoke\r\n• 2 window-type air conditioners\r\n• 2 split-type air conditioners\r\n• Beds, cabinets, and more\r\n\r\nEverything is included. Just bring your clothes and move in.\r\n\r\nPricing Options:\r\nOption A: Spot Cash – 6,000,000\r\nOption B: Assume Pag-IBIG\r\n• Assume price: 3,500,000\r\n• Monthly amortization: 20,387",
